IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sme-hiring`

-- Shared Mobility Enterprises (Control and Licensing) Act 2020, ss 2, 3, 8, 23, 25, 29, 34, 36, 37, 38, 39 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_shared-mobility-enterprises-control-and-licensing-act-2020.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

